      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Official game worlds could allow us to save our stats and progress I assume. So we could have much more complex stuff or simple scoreboards that are saved for let's say the top ten players. I really hope Udon allows that for worlds created by the community. If not we may be able to create more complex games where you have to start from zero every time you enter the world. That's rather frustrating. Imagine a shooter with a ranking system or a racing game where you can tune the cars. It would be worthless without saving the progress.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
