      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with those guessing that Udon will increase the number of quality games in VRC.  However I think it would be great if they had at least one very technically skilled person on staff whose job it was to help out promising maps, helping with not just bugs which I assume happens to some extent already, but also helps more generally spur them along.  There's already lots of community help, but having a dev with deep knowledge of Udon and time to develop the best community efforts would be positive.  This may happen though already to some extent.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
