  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-05T08:30:17.348Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I'm here today to talk about the low number of official game maps.\n\nLots of other free VR social games have lots of games to play for social interaction and keep people into the game, yes there is lots of user created maps for vrchat but these maps maybe lacking or broken and not optimized enough for a large party that can kill the mood, I don't think its a good idea to rely on the community to fill a recreational need that may require a professional touch also by having lots of quality game maps would make the game easier to sell to the gaming world which bring more people into the game and may give vrchat more of a gaming identity and instead of relying on a social one also I had friends get bored of vrchat for a lack of games to keep their interest and will leave, please consider bringing more official game maps in the future.",
